&#127754; Welcome to Petite Frog – Your Cozy Watercolor Retreat! &#127754;

&#127958;️ Beach & Pool Fun: Up to 4 wristbands for Watercolor pools & amenities (ages 5+) &#127903;️ 2 beach chairs & umbrellas for guest use &#127958;️ 1-minute walk to Frog Pool &#128056;&#128166; Access to Camp Watercolor: multiple pools, waterslides, lazy river & cantina &#127754;&#127881; Access to Watercolor Beach Club & pools for 4 guests &#127946;‍♂️ Community pools heated during cooler months ♨️ Towel service available at Camp Watercolor & Beach Club &#129524;

&#128692;‍♀️ Ride & Explore: Complimentary 4 beach cruiser bikes &#128690; &#128719;️ Comfort & Style: Designer interiors & soft cotton bedding &#128715;️&#128716; Cable & Wi-Fi &#128250;&#127760; Smart TV – sign into your favorite streaming services &#127916;

&#127869;️ Kitchen & Patio: Open-air patio with propane grill & rocking chairs &#128293;

&#127922; Extras & Entertainment: Beach toys, books & games available &#127958;️&#128218;&#127922;

&#128663; Parking: Driveway parking for 2 vehicles &#127359;️

SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS

- Carriage House Loft: Queen bed and Queen sleeper sofa with Private Shower/Tub Combo

We provide 2 beach chairs and umbrellas for your use during your stay.

This listing is for the Petite Frog, our cozy carriage house located on the property. It’s the perfect spot for a quiet getaway or a couple’s retreat. When you book the Petite Frog:

- You’ll have the carriage house all to yourself. - Please note there is not a washer/dryer or freezer in the carriage house. - The main house (Southern Frog) will remain vacant — we do not rent it to other guests at the same time. - If you’d like both the main house and carriage house together, please see: https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1335584435406043798?source_impression_id=p3_1756053760_P3O5e23P4VcpiPKq

